+# Conventions as lint rules (2026-11-02)
+
+Documented conventions of `apps/react-vite` are enforced with built-in ESLint rules instead of AGENTS.md prose.
+Built-ins only: the legacy `.eslintrc.cjs` has no local-rule mechanism, and adding `eslint-plugin-local-rules` would change `package.json`.
